      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging MoNbTaW at 600–700 °C for 10–20 hours will induce beneficial local chemical order.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed optimized aging profile will induce local order without forming deleterious coarse precipitates.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The induced structural mediator will consist of short-range-ordering clusters within the MoNbTaW solid-solution matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased local chemical order reduces the difference between the mobilities of irradiation-induced interstitials and vacancies.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10104586::web::001::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Local chemical order localizes interstitial diffusion by altering point-defect migration-energy barriers.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::001::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narrowing the interstitial-vacancy mobility difference promotes their recombination.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10104586::web::001::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Promoted point-defect recombination delays irradiation-damage initiation and improves irradiation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10104586::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10104586::web::001::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The irradiation-resistance mechanism demonstrated for CrCoNi will also operate in additively manufactured MoNbTaW.",
